# Stack

- Expo Development Builds (not Expo Go)
- React Native
- TypeScript (strict)
- Zustand
- expo-sqlite
- NativeWind
- React Navigation

# Folder Structure

All source code lives under `src/`.

Use:

- src/components/ui
- src/features
- src/services
- src/store
- src/theme
- src/types

# Principles

- Use theme tokens.
- Use functional components.
- Avoid `any`.
- Keep components small and composable.
